::  comlink/glow/fold-mycelium-cache-weave.glow -- Cache Weave!
/-  compiler-shapes
/!  32768
|%
++  fold-cache-share-packet
  |=  [count=@ud entry-bytes=@ud header=@ud mtu=@ud]   ::  packet bound
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  wire bytes
  ~|  'mycelium-cache-packet-exceeds-comlink-mtu'       ::  MTU refusal
  =+  wire  (add header (mul count entry-bytes))        ::  total bytes
  ?>  lte(wire mtu)
  wire
--
